{"id":"6bcabc1514ef3a19","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-universal-disjunction.md","title":"全称量词与析取","display":"df-universal-disjunction — 全称量词与析取","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-universal-disjunction","aliases":["29-df-universal-disjunction"],"display":"df-universal-disjunction — 全称量词与析取","depends_on":["[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-formula]]"],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-universal-disjunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-universal-disjunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-disjunction — 全称量词与析取"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\tau\">\\(D_\\tau\\)</span> 是按严格子树递归定义的语法函数，不把原公式构造集中互异的全称、存在或二元标签强行判为同一语法树。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\tau(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\quad D_\\tau(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land D_\\tau(\\psi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,D_\\tau(\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\tau(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\quad D_\\tau(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land D_\\tau(\\psi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,D_\\tau(\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\tau(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists x\\,\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\tau(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists x\\,\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\tau(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi)),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi))\\land\\neg(D_\\tau(\\psi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\tau(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi)),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi))\\land\\neg(D_\\tau(\\psi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\qquad A\\models\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models D_\\tau(\\phi)[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\qquad A\\models\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models D_\\tau(\\phi)[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留全称与析取的可消去性内容，修正原先用定义等号把互异构造子直接等同的问题。新函数给出实际的语法展开，最后一式是语义等价，不是树相等。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$；语义取 [[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\tau(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\quad D_\\tau(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land D_\\tau(\\psi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,D_\\tau(\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"D_\\tau(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists x\\,\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi)).","display":true},{"tex":"D_\\tau(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi)),\\quad D_\\tau(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\coloneqq\\neg(D_\\tau(\\phi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\psi))\\land\\neg(D_\\tau(\\psi)\\land\\neg D_\\tau(\\phi)).","display":true},{"tex":"D_\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\qquad A\\models\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models D_\\tau(\\phi)[\\beta].","display":true}],"bytes":2154,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-universal-disjunction]]"}],"outgoing":["3ee556c64b16809b","a3fa1d78e657e6a2"]}